msgstr "Este carpaccio está hecho con un suave pulpo de Hokkaido y lleva salsa ponzu picante."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89030\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A salad of avocado and shrimp topped with a light, perfectly matched Japanese dressing."
msgstr "Una ensalada de aguacate y camarones, complementada perfectamente con un aderezo japonés ligero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89118\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Spicy, bite-sized Hawaiian sausages. They go great with beer."
msgstr "Salchichas hawaianas picantes y pequeñas. Son perfectas con una cerveza."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89180\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A stick of burdock, with all the crisp texture and fresh aroma this healthy vegetable brings to the table."
msgstr "Un trozo de bardana, con toda la textura crujiente y el aroma fresco que este saludable vegetal aporta a la mesa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89287\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Made by seasoning Hokkaido Matilda potatoes with green chili peppers and chipotle salt."
msgstr "Elaborado sazonando papas Matilda de Hokkaido con chiles verdes y sal de chipotle."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89375\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Seasoned with green chili peppers and chipotle salt before roasting in an oven."
msgstr "Sazonado con chiles verdes y sal de chipotle antes de asarlo en el horno."

#. y4:line_status=translated
