msgstr "Esta pizza romana básica está hecha con tomates frescos y albahaca."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89577\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This gin-based cocktail is mixed with ginger ale and a squeeze of lime."
msgstr "Este cóctel a base de ginebra se mezcla con ginger-ale y un chorrito de limón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89649\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This delicious drink is made by mixing tequila with soda and plenty of lime."
msgstr "Esta deliciosa bebida se prepara mezclando tequila con soda y abundante limón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89726\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This cocktail is a mixture of tequila with bittersweet blood orange juice."
msgstr "Este cóctel es una mezcla de tequila con jugo de naranja sanguina agridulce."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89801\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A drink loved the world over for its bittersweet magic."
msgstr "Una bebida amada en todo el mundo por su magia agridulce."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89857\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A mixture of Kahlua liqueur and milk for everyone's favorite cocktail."
msgstr "Una mezcla de licor Kahlua y leche para hacer el cóctel favorito de todos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "89928\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This drink is made by mixing Kakubin with lemon and soda. The \"XL\" refers to its size, so you can take your time drinking it."
msgstr "Esta bebida se prepara mezclando Kakubin con limón y soda. El \"XL\" hace referencia a su tamaño, así que puedes disfrutarla con calma."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90054\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This lighter drink made by mixing Kakubin with enough lemon and soda to soften the taste. The \"XL\" refers to its size."
msgstr "Esta bebida ligera se prepara mezclando Kakubin con suficiente limón y soda para suavizar el sabor. El \"XL\" hace referencia a su tamaño."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90173\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A popular cocktail with a coconut flavor that will remind you of a warm southern island."
msgstr "Un cóctel popular con sabor a coco que te recordará a una cálida isla del sur."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90262\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Yamazaki whisky mixed with lemon and soda served in a copper tumbler to keep it cold."
msgstr "Whisky Yamazaki mezclado con limón y soda, servido en un vaso de cobre para mantenerlo frío."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90348\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Spaghetti made with eggplant, tomato sauce, and savory bacon imported from Denmark."
msgstr "Espaguetis elaborados con berenjena, salsa de tomate y sabroso tocino importado de Dinamarca."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90432\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Our Shrimp & Tomato Spaghetti is made with succulent mini shrimps and rich tomato cream sauce for a delightful meal."
msgstr "Nuestro espagueti de camarones y tomate está hecho con suculentos camarones pequeños y una rica salsa de crema de tomate, para una comida deliciosa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90549\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Carefully simmered, rich meat sauce on our specially prepared spaghetti noodles."
msgstr "Rica salsa de carne cuidadosamente condimentada sobre nuestros espaguetis especialmente preparados."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90630\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This delicious spaghetti dish is made with spicy chili pepper cod roe."
msgstr "Este delicioso plato de espagueti se prepara con huevas de bacalao picantes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90701\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This is our Rich Egg Carbonara, featuring creamy sauce and a tasty soft-boiled egg on top."
msgstr "Esta es nuestra rica Carbonara de huevo, con salsa cremosa y un sabroso huevo pochado por encima."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90792\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Nothing like a swig of grapefruit juice to cool you down. Tangy, refreshing, and full of vitamins."
msgstr "Nada como un trago de jugo de toronja para refrescarse. Ácido, refrescante y lleno de vitaminas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90891\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Made from freshly juiced Italian oranges that provide a refreshing blend of sweet and sour flavors."
msgstr "Hecho con naranjas italianas recién exprimidas que ofrecen una mezcla refrescante de sabores dulces y ácidos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "90991\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This hot coffee is made with 100 percent Brazilian coffee beans for a rich, authentic flavor."
msgstr "Este café caliente está hecho con 100％ granos de café brasileño para un sabor rico y auténtico."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91085\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Made with 100 percent Brazilian coffee beans. Smooth and delicious."
msgstr "Hecho con granos de café 100% brasileños. Suave y delicioso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91153\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "An impressive combination of rich milk and Brazilian coffee beans."
msgstr "Una combinación impresionante de leche cremosa y granos de café brasileños."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91220\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "An impressive blend of rich espresso and frothy milk."
msgstr "Una mezcla clásica de un rico expreso y leche espumosa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91274\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A popular drink made with espresso, chocolate, and cocoa."
msgstr "Una bebida popular a base de espresso, chocolate y cacao."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91332\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A rich, refreshing beverage made with fresh milk."
msgstr "Una bebida deliciosa y refrescante elaborada con leche fresca."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "91382\tEXPLANATION"
