#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212625\tMORE_EXPLANATION3"
msgid "Fishing Tips-\n\nVarious types of fish are out there, each with\ntheir own particular habitats. Try searching\ndifferent spots with various kinds of bait to\npull up that fish you've been dreaming of!"
msgstr "Consejos de pesca-\n\nExisten varios tipos de peces, cada uno con\nsus propios hábitats particulares. Intenta buscar\ndiferentes lugares con varios tipos de cebo para\n¡Saca ese pez con el que has estado soñando!"

